me of the most important products that Apple unveiled on Tuesday:&\nA new MacBook Air that features a 13.3-inch Retina display with 4 million pixels , and replaces the aluminum border around the display with a black bezel. The new MacBook Air is 17% less volume than its predecessor and includes cool, new features like Touch ID.& A new Mac Mini with up to 64 GB of memory (previously, 16 GB was the limit) and which is five times faster than before.& The new iPad Pro has an edge-to-edge, 11-inch LCD \"Liquid Retina\" display . It also says workloads on the new iPad Pro are now up to 90% faster, and graphics performance is 1,000 times faster.& The new Apple Pencil attaches to the iPad magnetically and charges wirelessly. The new MacBook Air, Mac Mini, and iPad Pro are all made from 100% recycled aluminum, a new alloy creation made by Apple's metallurgy team.& You can read Business Insider's full coverage of the Apple event here SEE ALSO:&\n Watch Apple's October 2018 event in 8 minutes", "external_links": ["http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=SjclohRi5T0:J9MulcyYsQY:cGdyc7Q-1BI", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=bcOpcFrp8Mo", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=SjclohRi5T0:J9MulcyYsQY:qj6IDK7rITs", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?i=SjclohRi5T0:J9MulcyYsQY:gIN9vFwOqvQ", "https://www.businessinsider.com/apple-october-event-live-blog-all-announcements-2018-10", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=SjclohRi5T0:J9MulcyYsQY:7Q72WNTAKBA", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=QXVau8BzmBE", "https://www.businessinsider.com/apple-event-ipad-pro-macbook-air-mini-2018-10", "https://www.businessinsider.com/apple-iphone-xs-event-september-live-blog-all-announcements-2018-9", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silico